in many, many communities with high crime. Schools are the safest places for our kids to be. And I know it's hard because as a parent, you know, we can imagine those school shootings and they're so horrendous and we've got to do everything we can to prevent them. But we've got to prevent the shootings that occur all over our society. We have about 300 shootings every day in the United States. We have over 100 people killed by gunfire every day in the United States. We just don't hear about those cases. We hear about the ones in the school building that are so heartrending, so heartbreaking.
